# ConsultarProyecto(): the student's graduation project, its current document and its history (UC-004 A4)
# The student sends it, without arguments or attachments. Run it before 11, to see that there is no profile yet,
# and after 11 or 12, to see the title, the current document with its status and the earlier profiles and versions.
# Sends the command to mail-app through the Mailpit API. The reply arrives after the next poll: see mailbox.http.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8025
@systemAddress = sistema@mailapp.local
@studentAddress = juan.soto@mailapp.local

### View the graduation project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "From": { "Email": "{{studentAddress}}" },
  "To": [{ "Email": "{{systemAddress}}" }],
  "Subject": "ConsultarProyecto()",
  "Text": ""
}
